Cell["\<\
numbers of diabolo/2-arms/3-arms metatiles using the 3x3 deflation matrix\
\>", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9448894554697027`*^9, 3.944889472818677*^9}, {
  3.944889523065419*^9, 3.944889530490317*^9}, {3.944889604666445*^9, 
