Cell["\<\
The total number of each metatile at each iteration are calculated using a  \
3x3 deflation matrix \[OpenCurlyQuote]mat\[CloseCurlyQuote] relating the \
numbers of metatiles at iteration i to that at iteration i+1.
\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.952490258523102*^9, 3.952490296350525*^9}, {
  3.952490414036409*^9, 3.9524904524899464`*^9}, {3.952490490906309*^9, 
