Cell["\<\
Perron root is the maximum eigenvalue.
Its irrationality proves the quasiperiodicity.
Here it is a quadratic irrational number (periodic tail of the continuous \
fraction).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.952490258523102*^9, 3.952490296350525*^9}, {
